{"date":"1987-08-21","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/51/4f/152093_qbFqb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/51/4f/152093_qbFqb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/51/4f/152093_qbFqb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/51/4f/152093_qbFqb.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/51/4f/152093_qbFqb.jpg"},"summary":"　　著名的剪纸艺术家百鬼丸，人如其名，是手塚治虫的忠实粉丝（译注：“百鬼丸”这个名字来源于手塚治虫作品中的角色），为了参与这部短篇动画的制作，他拒绝了其他所有的工作邀约。这个故事围绕着一把插在稻草人身上的妖刀——村正而展开。拿到这把刀的武士为了试验其锋利程度，每当见到稻草人就会接连不断地挥刀砍去。然而，稻草人在被斩断的瞬间，却变成了人的模样。作品映射了建立在核平衡之上的现代和平，为我们敲响了和平的警钟。","name":"村正","name_cn":"村正","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":33,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚治虫","count":28,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1987","count":19,"total_cont":0},{"name":"虫Production","count":9,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":8,"total_cont":0},{"name":"剧场版","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚PRODUCTION","count":4,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日本动画","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"泡面番","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"实验","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1980s","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"旧物","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手冢治虫","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"OVA","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚PRO","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1987年","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚プロダクション","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"实验动画","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"85-89","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日本","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"年","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"村正"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"手塚治虫实验动画：村正"},{"v":"Muramasa"}]},{"key":"上映年度","value":"1987年8月21日"},{"key":"片长","value":"9分钟"},{"key":"官方网站","value":"https://tezukaosamu.net/sc/anime/76.html"},{"key":"制片国家/地区","value":"日本"},{"key":"话数","value":"1"},{"key":"其他","value":"于第2届广岛国际动画电影节（原名：広島国際アニメーション映画祭）上映"}],"rating":{"rank":5463,"total":51,"count":{"1":0,"2":0,"3":0,"4":7,"5":15,"6":16,"7":8,"8":1,"9":2,"10":2},"score":5.9},"total_episodes"